# DST: New York (own VTIMEZONE, 2nd Sunday of March / 1st Sunday of November: 2026-03-08 and
# 2026-11-01), a Berlin VTIMEZONE with -1SU rules (2026-03-29 and 2026-10-25), the fallbacks.
# 2026-11-01 01:30 New York is ambiguous: the first (daylight) instant. 02:30 on 2026-03-08 does
# not exist: the offset before the gap (-05:00), i.e. 03:30 EDT.
# window: 20260101T000000Z 20270101T000000Z
# local: Pacific Standard Time
